+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+This project's currently recorded decision is to use Argon2id as the password hashing algorithm, adopted via an accepted code review comment; no later decision has been recorded to supersede it, so Argon2id should be treated as the authoritative choice until a new decision is recorded.
